WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.968 --> 00:00:02.267
-It is the holiday season,

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.701
and the Rockefeller Center
Christmas tree is here.

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:05.334
If you guys haven't seen it yet,
here it is.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:08.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:09.901
-Wow.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.300
-I don't want to say
anything too mean.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.167
It looks like it could use
some encouragement

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:18.501
before its big lighting
later this month,

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:19.968
so I wrote a tiny song.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.968
I hope you like it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:36.667
♪ You're 82 feet
and essentially flawless ♪

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:41.367
♪ But we can't help but notice
you have male pattern baldness ♪

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:45.667
♪ Just a week ago, we couldn't
wait for you to show up ♪

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.934
♪ But now we're
all wondering when

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:50.334
you'll g-g-g-g-glow up ♪

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:54.868
♪ Time for a glow-up,
a Midtown makeover ♪

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:59.000
♪ Let's get the "Queer Eye" guys
to do a t-t-t-t-takeover ♪

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.567
♪ It's time for a glow-up,
you're looking pretty poor-ah ♪

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:08.133
♪ So let's go get free samples
at S-S-S-S-Sephora ♪

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:12.534
♪ It's time for a glow-up,
you might need to go faster ♪

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:16.934
♪ We don't want to wait,
this isn't T-T-Ticketmaster ♪

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:21.334
♪ It's time for a glow-up,
I know you're not a quitter ♪

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:25.601
♪ At least you're doing better
than they are at T-T-T-Twitter ♪

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:28.634
♪ It's time for glow-up ♪

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.634
♪ It's time for glow-up ♪

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:37.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.634
Thank you.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.467
Thank you very much.

